    "description": "FreeCharge Advisory Limited has an exciting opening for a Investment Banker at our Bhubaneswar office. Join a company that values innovation, collaboration, and continuous learning.\n\nAbout FreeCharge Advisory Limited:\nFreeCharge Advisory Limited is a leading organization in the Remote sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Ensure compliance with tax regulations and statutory requirements\n• Maintain general ledger and ensure accurate bookkeeping\n• Implement and maintain internal controls and audit procedures\n• Manage accounts payable and accounts receivable functions\n• Prepare MIS reports for senior management review\n• Prepare and analyze financial statements, reports, and budgets\n• Liaise with banks, regulators, and financial institutions\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• Master's degree preferred\n• 1-3 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in SAP FICO\n• Proficiency in Financial Modeling\n• Proficiency in SQL\n• Proficiency in QuickBooks\n• Proficiency in Python for Finance\n• Proficiency in Income Tax\n• Proficiency in MS Excel\n• Proficiency in Tally\n\nWork Mode: Remote - Work from anywhere in India\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Comprehensive health insurance for self and family\n• Meal coupons and food allowance\n• Annual performance appraisal\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Transportation and conveyance allowance\n• Referral bonus program\n• Salary Range: 4 LPA - 9 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Bhubaneswar, Odisha, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with FreeCharge Advisory Limited!",
